  "solution": "Logic : (1st number × 3rd number × 10) = 2nd number\n\nGiven : \n\n__\n \n• (8, 720, 9)\n\n**8 × 9 × 10**__ = 720\n\n720 = 720 (LHS = RHS)\n\n__\n \n• (16, 800, 5)\n\n16 × 5 × 10__ = 800\n\n800 = 800 (LHS = RHS)\n\nSo,\n\n__\n \n• Option - (1) : 7, 125, 8\n\n7 × 8 × 10__ = 125\n\n560 ≠ 125 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (2) : 13, 169, 5\n\n13 × 5 × 10__ = 169\n\n650 ≠ 169 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (3) : 14, 238, 5\n\n14 × 5 × 10__ = 238\n\n700 ≠ 238 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\n__\n \n• Option - (4) : 18, 1260, 7\n\n18 × 7 × 10__ = 1260\n\n1260 = 1260 (LHS = RHS) \n\nHence, \"Option - (4)\" is the correct answer.",
